title: 엔딩50_서은표_영문
---
<<bg 검은화면>>
(After becoming quite close with EunPyo...)
(At her suggestion,)
(I ended up joining the soccer club.)
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: You're here, {name()}? Let's start our warm-up together~
(To be honest, I don't think I have much talent for soccer,)
(But I like it because EunPyo seems so happy to have me there.)
(EunPyo is surprisingly professional when she's with the soccer club.)
(She's not the captain, but she definitely feels like one...)
(It's fun seeing so many new sides of her.)
{name()}: What are we practicing today?
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: First, we'll do some warming up~ and then I think we're doing shooting drills?
{name()}: Right. I'm definitely going to score a goal today.
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Yeah! Give it your best shot.
(So far, I haven't managed to score a single goal against EunPyo during shooting drills.)
(EunPyo promised to grant me one wish if I ever score.)
(If that actually happens...)
(My wish would probably be.)
<<play 서은표_흠>>
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: What are you thinking about?
{name()}: Hmm. I was just thinking about what to wish for.
<<show pyo_neg>>
EunPyo: What do you want to wish for?
{name()}: I don't know.
{name()}: I wonder if you'd say yes if I asked you to go out with me...
<<hide>>
<<bg 서은표_일반엔딩>>
(When I blurted it out playfully, EunPyo's face turned beet red.)
EunPyo: What on earth...!!!
EunPyo: Who says things like that while doing jumping jacks...
{name()}: Hehe.
(I'm out of breath after chatting and warming up at the same time.)
(I wonder when I'll finally be able to score that goal?)
(I'll have to practice hard.)
(Maybe, just maybe, EunPyo might go easy on me today.)
<<wait 1>>
<<end>>
===